  <h2>Reflect and plan the next use</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Can you do this without the page?</h3>
    <p>Explain why <span class="ex">Maya worked there for ten years</span> can be past simple even though it is long, while <span class="ex">The light was flashing at six</span> can be continuous even though each flash is brief. Then contrast one open scene with one bounded event.</p>
    <p>Choose your next use: retell the outage with fewer notes, ask three camera-detail questions, or complete the retrieval below tomorrow.</p>
  </div>

